rights.body:
Under Art. 18 of the LGPD you can at any time:

- confirm whether we process your data and access it;
- correct incomplete, inaccurate or outdated data;
- ask for unnecessary or excessive data, or data processed unlawfully, to be anonymised, blocked or erased;
- receive your data in a structured format (portability);
- erase data processed with your consent and withdraw that consent;
- know who we share your data with;
- object to processing that breaks the law.

In Settings > Profile you can correct your data, download a full copy of it and delete your account. For anything else, write to {{dpo_email}}: we answer within 15 days. You can also file a complaint with the ANPD (www.gov.br/anpd).

conduct.body:
You may not:

- use other people's table codes or try to guess them;
- post offensive, discriminatory or unlawful messages, comments or reviews, or ones with other people's personal data;
- try to access data or areas without permission, overload or attack the platform;
- use the platform for fraud or for purposes other than those intended.

We may remove content and suspend accounts that break these terms.
